lisa-design:
Lineage children now extend below controls to Risks and Evidence, in the NORMAL tree (no separate graph view / no ?view=graph param — the user explicitly kept groups and dropped the view toggle). Structure: catalog -> groups -> controls -> (implementing/documenting controls) + Risks directly linked to the control (risk_control_links) -> latest Evidence per linked stream (risk_evidence_links). New node kinds/keys: risk:<riskId>, evidence:<streamUuid>; new nodeTypes "risk" and "evidence"; new LineageNode fields riskId/evidenceId/status/score (all omitempty). Risk node carries its own bucketed risk block + status + numeric score (likelihood x impact); evidence node is a leaf carrying its latest state. Risks appear under ANY control that has linked risks (not only leaves). Risk/evidence children are loaded lazily on expansion (not in buildEngine), SSP/component-scoped consistently with loadRisks. GOTCHA: evidences.uuid is TEXT while risk_evidence_links.evidence_id is UUID — the evidence-per-risk join casts `rel.evidence_id::text = e.uuid`.
